# Every text file is LF, in the repository and in working copies, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# Git for Windows defaults to autocrlf=true, which checks files out as CRLF, while the tools that
# rewrite them (cargo tauri dev syncing Cargo.toml, npm, formatters) write LF. Git then reported
# those files as modified with no change in their content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
